OrionLayer open fix 74 — the Energy Absorber's discharge as a battle event
=======================================================================

Work order 210 (Part B3, Data's decision 3). orion2re on `orionlayer-local`, on top of
a8b5640b (open fix 70). src/game only, every line under ORION2RE_EXT.

`Energy_Absorber_Attack_` (cmbtfire.cpp:1787-1854) fires weapon 0x2E through
`BEAMS::Beam_SFX_` with the stored charge and may destroy its target, and it
reported nothing: HD saw the charge go and the target's structure fall, or a
`destroy` with no visible cause. It now records the CEV_BEAM_SHOT the drawing
is: source, target, flag 0, slot -1 (no weapon slot), weapon 0x2E, the damage
result bits, the damage past shields and the shield's share — after the
damage, before the target's death (CEV_DESTROY follows from Destroy_Ship_).

